Before going deep into Boto3, understand these AWS concepts:


AWS Account
   │
   ├── Region
   │     ├── AZ
   │     └── AWS Services
   │
   └── IAM
         ├── User
         ├── Role
         └── Policy


Services:
| Service         | Purpose              |
| --------------- | -------------------- |
| S3              | Object storage       |
| EC2             | Virtual machines     |
| IAM             | Identity/access      |
| Lambda          | Serverless functions |
| DynamoDB        | NoSQL database       |
| RDS             | Relational database  |
| VPC             | Networking           |
| CloudWatch      | Monitoring/logs      |
| SQS             | Message queue        |
| SNS             | Notifications        |
| ECR             | Container images     |
| ECS             | Containers           |
| Secrets Manager | Secrets              |
| Systems Manager | Server management    |


Boto3 is essentially your Python interface to these services.
